Search language detector

The language model of this module (be/imgn/search/langdetect/internal/languages.model)
is derived from sentences of Tatoeba (https://tatoeba.org), released under the
Creative Commons Attribution 2.0 France licence (CC BY 2.0 FR,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0/fr/).

The held-out samples its tests use (src/test/resources) are Tatoeba sentences too,
under the same licence.
